{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink"},"abstract":[{"text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"title":"Presenting from a link"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier asks with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link, as a QR code or a link on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its page. Register the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links open the app, and hand the link to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)"},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the Verifier’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed request, checks its certificate against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots"},{"type":"text","text":", and finds the credentials that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything is shown."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation"},{"type":"text","text":" it returns says:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"who is asking: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", its name, and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when a registrar the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet trusts ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") registered it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what it asks for: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", each with the held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials that can answer it, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Present","anchor":"Present"},{"code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","    let disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()"},{"type":"text","text":" picks the first credential that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection"},{"type":"text","text":" from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each query’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" instead: a query that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selection, after checking it answers the request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection"},{"type":"text","text":" otherwise), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)"},{"type":"text","text":" says what it would disclose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without signing or sending anything: show that before the holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"agrees."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI"},{"type":"text","text":", when the Verifier sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, in the browser the request came from: it’s how a same-device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flow returns to the Verifier’s page."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Show what’s being asked beyond a registration","anchor":"Show-whats-being-asked-beyond-a-registration"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration, each query’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregistered"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the claims it asks for beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it’s registered to request, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregisteredAll"},{"type":"text","text":" whether it asks for every claim."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is refused for them: show them, and let the holder decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Keep presentations unlinkable","anchor":"Keep-presentations-unlinkable"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each presentation uses a copy of the credential, bound to its own key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so two Verifiers can’t link the holder’s presentations by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/copyPolicy-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" chooses which copy:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perPresentation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the default: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copy no Verifier has seen, every time."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perVerifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": the copy a Verifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has seen before, so it can recognize a returning holder, and an unused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one for a new Verifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once every copy is used, one is reused. A candidate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether presenting it now would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand this Verifier a copy another has seen: warn the holder, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh the credential ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":") when its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" reaches zero."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"When delivery is uncertain","anchor":"When-delivery-is-uncertain"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If sending the response fails in a way that leaves it unknown whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifier received it, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/respond(selection:)"},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/deliveryUnknown"},{"type":"text","text":" and doesn’t send it again: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder should check with the Verifier before sharing again."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink"],"anchor":"Presenting-from-a-link","gen